  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArticlePageData
  title: Puppy Play Date Guidelines
  bodyText: "LOCAL NEWS: The City Dog Shelter is hosting an all-day Puppy Play Date!\r\n\r\nBy
    Maya Lin & Austin Rivera | New Manila Local News\r\n\r\nNed a shot of happiness
    ? The New Manila City Dog Shelter is opening its doors for an all-day Puppy Play
    Date this October 25th ! Lucal residents can drop in to play with rescue pops
    and even adapt if you find your match !\r\n\r\nQuick Event Breakdown\r\n\r\nThe
    Event: All-day puppy playtime & on-site adoption opportunitties\r\n\r\nWhere:
    New Manila City Dog Shaltear \r\n\r\nRequirement: No registration required\r\n\r\nHow
    to Join in 3 Steps\r\n\r\nVisit the New Manila City Dog Shelter website events
    page.\r\n\r\nTake note of timeslots on the website.\r\n\r\nShow up at the shelter
    branch and enjoy!\r\n\r\n#LocalNews #CityDogShelter #PuppyPlayDate #AdoptLocal
    #CommunityEvent\r\n"
